{"r":3,"c":[[54,"As with most optical devices, handle the OPT3001 with special care to ensure optical surfaces stay clean and"]]}
{"r":4,"c":[[54,"free from damage. See the Do's and Don'ts section for more detailed recommendations. For best optical"]]}
{"r":5,"c":[[54,"performance, solder flux and any other possible debris must be cleaned after soldering processes."]]}
