{"r":13,"c":[[54,"acknowledging the alert response and sending their respective I2C address on the bus. The alert response can"]]}
{"r":14,"c":[[54,"activate several different slave devices simultaneously. If more than one slave attempts to respond, bus"]]}
{"r":15,"c":[[54,"arbitration rules apply. The device with the lowest address wins the arbitration. If the OPT3001 loses the"]]}
